        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Workspace Topological Adjacency\n\n## Core invariant\n\n**Bridges dictate adjacency. Graph position does not.**\n\nMoving a graph changes the current 2D embedding. It does not change authored bridge relationships. The workspace derives regions, shared boundaries, and apertures from that topology."
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "workspace-topological-adjacency-declaration"
        }
      }
